35,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"Only two firms tender for earth-moving, and they flagged clay subsoil risk. That is a major constraint.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The drainage callouts have doubled since the culvert was capped. The ground is clearly struggling with water.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Minato,,"The groundskeeping roll is down to seven posts. We are buying in specialist care, which is expensive.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Minako,,The apron outside the civic hall has been patched three times. Our previous works are failing fast.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,The upkeep ledger shows planted ground costs triple to maintain compared to hard surfaces. That is a huge gap.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Benjamin, if the drainage is failing, does that rule out any water-heavy plans?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Kenji, it suggests we need robust drainage, not just more water features. The heat readings are also high.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Minato,,"@Jonathan, if planting is so expensive to keep, maybe we should avoid dense woodland?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Minako,,"@Minato, the eastern avenue trees died because aftercare was missing. It is not just the cost, it is the management.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Minako, the habitat fund only pays for planting and water, not buildings. That limits our options significantly.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minako""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Kenji,,"The phasing notes say the south can be hoarded, but the centre cannot. We need a plan that works in stages.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,"The timed counts show people stick to firm, open ground. They avoid the softer margins.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Minato,,"The volunteer groups are active, but they are casual. They cannot replace the lost professional staff.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Minako,,The overflow basin from eight years ago is still fine. That tells us water management can work if done right.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,The fund terms are strict. We cannot build a market plaza or sports terraces with that money.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
